  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Shared platform",
      "items": [
        "All nine APIs use common-starter modules for security, clients, messaging and observability",
        "PostgreSQL, Redis, Kong and tracing are shared platform infrastructure",
        "REST is synchronous; RabbitMQ with outbox and DLQ handles asynchronous integration"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Operations",
      "items": [
        "Grafana, Prometheus and Loki monitor API health, metrics and logs",
        "The central MFE is a gradual migration target; central-ui remains in production"
      ]
    }
